### 3. `resource/ts/pages/main/scene/main.scene.ts` — 카운트업 인터랙션

**변경 위치:**

A) 파일 상단 상수 영역에 추가:
```typescript
const STORY_STAT_SELECTOR = '[data-count-to]';
const STORY_STATS_SELECTOR = '[data-story-stats]';
const STORY_COUNT_TRIGGER = 0.12;  // story progress threshold
```

B) 상태 변수 영역에 추가:
```typescript
let storyStatsFired = false;
```

C) 새 함수 추가 (syncWhoScene 등 다른 sync 함수들 옆에):
```typescript
function triggerStoryStats(): void {
  const items = Array.from(
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(STORY_STAT_SELECTOR)
  );
  if (!items.length) return;

  const DURATION = 1800;
  const STAGGER = 150;

  items.forEach((el, i) => {
    const target = Number(el.dataset.countTo ?? 0);
    let startTime: number | null = null;

    function tick(ts: number): void {
      if (startTime === null) startTime = ts;
      const t = Math.min((ts - startTime) / DURATION, 1);
      // ease-out cubic
      const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);
      el.textContent = Math.round(eased * target).toString();
      if (t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    }

    window.setTimeout(() => requestAnimationFrame(tick), i * STAGGER);
  });
}
```

D) `story: {}` 핸들러 업데이트:
```typescript
story: {
  onProgress: (progress: number): void => {
    if (!storyStatsFired && progress >= STORY_COUNT_TRIGGER) {
      storyStatsFired = true;
      triggerStoryStats();
    }
  },
},
```

**재사용 패턴 참조:**
- `IntroLoadingRuntime.ts` — `gsap.to(state, { value, onUpdate })` 숫자 트위닝 패턴
- `main.scene.ts` 기존 `syncWhoScene` / `syncClientItems` — `onProgress` 콜백 패턴

